From bf17bb4cc13342919d53adc85ca59b0246995093 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:27:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] SEQ MIDI OUT: send the sequencer's notes, step position,
 clock and start/stop over USB MIDI

Each track plays out on its MIDI channel (T1..T6 CHANNEL): notes and drum
hits with velocity, ratchets, flams and slides as played; CC 102 = step
index on entering a step; MIDI Clock (24 ppq), Start and Stop with the
INT clock. MENU > MIDI > SEQ MIDI OUT turns it off (ON by default).
Adds tests/seqmidi_test.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QUnBRshuyKRXwZRuQuZqVi
